name: ['A-Binding Geist // A-Spectral Binding', 'Abrade', 'Adamant Will', 'Aim for the Head', "Alchemist's Gambit", "Alchemist's Retrieval", 'Alluring Suitor // Deadly Dancer', 'Ancestral Anger', 'Ancient Lumberknot', 'Angelic Quartermaster', 'Anje, Maid of Dishonor', 'Apprentice Sharpshooter', 'Archghoul of Thraben', 'Arm the Cathars', 'Ascendant Packleader', 'Avabruck Caretaker // Hollowhenge Huntmaster', 'Ballista Watcher // Ballista Wielder', 'Belligerent Guest', 'Binding Geist // Spectral Binding', 'Biolume Egg // Biolume Serpent', 'Bleed Dry', 'Blood Fountain', 'Blood Hypnotist', 'Blood Petal Celebrant', 'Blood Servitor', 'Bloodcrazed Socialite', 'Bloodsworn Squire // Bloodsworn Knight', 'Bloodtithe Harvester', 'Bloodvial Purveyor', 'Bloody Betrayal', 'Boarded Window', 'Bramble Armor', 'Bramble Wurm', "Bride's Gown", 'Brine Comber // Brinebound Gift', 'By Invitation Only', "Cartographer's Survey", 'Catapult Fodder // Catapult Captain', 'Cemetery Desecrator', 'Cemetery Gatekeeper', 'Cemetery Illuminator', 'Cemetery Protector', 'Cemetery Prowler', 'Ceremonial Knife', 'Chandra, Dressed to Kill', 'Change of Fortune', 'Child of the Pack // Savage Packmate', 'Chill of the Grave', 'Circle of Confinement', 'Cloaked Cadet', 'Cobbled Lancer', 'Concealing Curtains // Revealing Eye', 'Consuming Tide', 'Courier Bat', 'Cradle of Safety', 'Crawling Infestation', 'Creepy Puppeteer', 'Cruel Witness', 'Crushing Canopy', 'Cultivator Colossus', 'Curse of Hospitality', 'Dawnhart Disciple', 'Dawnhart Geist', 'Daybreak Combatants', 'Deathcap Glade', 'Demonic Bargain', 'Desperate Farmer // Depraved Harvester', 'Dig Up', 'Diregraf Scavenger', 'Distracting Geist // Clever Distraction', 'Diver Skaab', 'Dollhouse of Horrors', 'Dominating Vampire', 'Doomed Dissenter', 'Dormant Grove // Gnarled Grovestrider', "Dorothea, Vengeful Victim // Dorothea's Retribution", 'Dread Fugue', 'Dreadfeast Demon', 'Dreadlight Monstrosity', 'Dreamroot Cascade', 'Dreamshackle Geist', 'Drogskol Infantry // Dr