uriosity', 'Moldgraf Millipede', 'Mountain', 'Mulch', "Nature's Embrace", 'Nebelgast Beguiler', 'Necroduality', 'Nurturing Presence', 'Oakshade Stalker // Moonlit Ambusher', 'Odric, Blood-Cursed', 'Old Rutstein', "Olivia's Attendants", 'Olivia, Crimson Bride', 'Ollenbock Escort', 'Overcharged Amalgam', 'Packsong Pup', 'Panicked Bystander // Cackling Culprit', 'Parasitic Grasp', 'Parish-Blade Trainee', 'Patchwork Crawler', 'Path of Peril', 'Persistent Specimen', 'Piercing Light', 'Plains', 'Pointed Discussion', 'Pyre Spawn', 'Radiant Grace // Radiant Restraints', 'Ragged Recluse // Odious Witch', 'Reckless Impulse', 'Reclusive Taxidermist', 'Rending Flame', 'Repository Skaab', 'Resistance Squad', 'Restless Bloodseeker // Bloodsoaked Reveler', 'Retrieve', 'Rot-Tide Gargantua', 'Runebound Wolf', 'Runo Stromkirk // Krothuss, Lord of the Deep', 'Rural Recruit', 'Sanctify', 'Sanguine Statuette', 'Savior of Ollenbock', 'Sawblade Slinger', 'Scattered Thoughts', 'Screaming Swarm', 'Selhoff Entomber', 'Serpentine Ambush', 'Shattered Sanctum', 'Sheltering Boughs', "Sigarda's Imprisonment", "Sigarda's Summons", 'Sigardian Paladin', 'Skulking Killer', 'Skull Skaab', 'Skywarp Skaab', 'Snarling Wolf', 'Sorin the Mirthless', 'Soulcipher Board // Cipherbound Spirit', 'Spiked Ripsaw', 'Splendid Reclamation', 'Spore Crawler', 'Sporeback Wolf', 'Steelclad Spirit', 'Stensia Uprising', 'Stitched Assistant', 'Stormcarved Coast', 'Stormchaser Drake', 'Sundown Pass', 'Supernatural Rescue', 'Sure Strike', 'Swamp', 'Syncopate', 'Syphon Essence', 'Thalia, Guardian of Thraben', 'Thirst for Discovery', 'Torens, Fist of the Angels', 'Toxic Scorpion', 'Toxrill, the Corrosive', 'Traveling Minister', 'Twinblade Geist // Twinblade Invocation', 'Ulvenwald Oddity // Ulvenwald Behemoth', 'Undead Butler', 'Undying Malice', 'Unhallowed Phalanx', 'Unholy Officiant', 'Valorous Stance', 'Vampire Slayer', "Vampire's Kiss", "Vampires' Vengeance", 'Vilespawn Spider', 'Voice of the Blessed', 'Volatile Arsonist /