ment — Aura', 'Enchantment — Aura Curse', 'Instant', 'Land', 'Legendary Artifact', 'Legendary Creature — Frog', 'Legendary Creature — Human Advisor', 'Legendary Creature — Human Cleric', 'Legendary Creature — Human Peasant', 'Legendary Creature — Human Ranger', 'Legendary Creature — Human Soldier', 'Legendary Creature — Human Wizard', 'Legendary Creature — Kraken Horror', 'Legendary Creature — Slug Horror', 'Legendary Creature — Spirit', 'Legendary Creature — Spirit Warlock', 'Legendary Creature — Vampire', 'Legendary Creature — Vampire Cleric', 'Legendary Creature — Vampire Noble', 'Legendary Creature — Vampire Soldier', 'Legendary Enchantment', 'Legendary Enchantment — Aura', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Chandra', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Kaya', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Sorin', 'Sorcery']
